flowchart TB
    Chunk[Retrieved Chunk<br/>with Provenance] --> Map[Backend Assigns S1, S2, ...<br/>and Keeps the Source Map]
    Map --> Context["Evidence Context Contains<br/>[S1] + Authoritative Chunk Text"]
    Context --> Model["Answer Model May Reference [S1]"]
    Model --> Validate[Backend Validates Every Citation<br/>Against Its Source Map]

    Validate -->|known source ID| Valid[Validated Citation<br/>Mapped to Retrieved Evidence]
    Validate -->|unknown source ID| Invalid[Remove Marker from Answer<br/>Do Not Accept It as a Source]

    Valid --> Snapshot[Stored ConversationMessageSource<br/>Snapshot]
    Snapshot --> UI[UI Source Details]

    Authority[The model can reference supplied IDs;<br/>it cannot create authoritative sources] -. trust boundary .-> Model

